    "description": "UBAR-LFS: Laffs Dynamics\n\nQoL improved variant of the original UBAR AR-15 3DP lower receiver. \n\nHas H&K style fire selector markings, an opened up trigger guard, and lightening cuts in the magwell for less material usage during printing. \n\nA small amount of material is removed from the rear of the receiver to allow for full tang AR grips to be utilized. \n\nIn the original UBAR design, the inside top section of the trigger guard (Where the trigger meets the receiver.) was wide open; this has been closed \noff to keep debris from entering the fire control group. \n\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 218C\nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .2mm \nStandard Layer Height: .16mm\nWall Perimeters: 8+ \nInfill: 60%+\nSupport Material Percentage: 18%\n\n\n\nNotes: \n\nThis file pack is for the receiver only. Other printed part files will need to be downloaded from the base design release; \nlinks provided in the below text.\n\n\n\nBase UBAR files can be found on Odysee: \n\nOdysee: https://odysee.com/@TheGatalog-PrintableFramesReceivers:9/UBAR-Rev1:e\n\n(Other print settings and the hardware list will be provided in the base data pack)\n\n\n\nAccreditations:\n\nIvan: Lead designer of the UBAR/UBolt V2 AR Lower Receiver; used his base model to create this variant. \n\nRK Spookware: Provided base hardware for AR lower receiver. ",
